This function accepts an address and one of its allowed field names.
```typescript
type Address = { street: string; town: string };
type AddressField = keyof Address;
function readAddress(address: Address, field: AddressField): string {
  return address[field];
}
console.log(readAddress({ street: "Oak Road", town: "Vale" }, "town"));
```
The output is Vale.
